WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
It was a quiet night at the atelier

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.200
at 30 Avenue Montaigne.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.700
The ribbons had been rolled away,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.000
the scissors were sleeping,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.720
and the mannequins rested in the soft moonlight.

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:03.720
All was peaceful, all was still, until...

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.720
Maison Christian Dior.

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.700
Ron here, calling from Hollywood.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.720
We got a problem.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:33.720
Monsieur Dior, Monsieur Dior, please wake up.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:37.720
What on earth is the matter?

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:40.720
Madame Dietrich, she won't wear the dress.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:41.720
Marlene?

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:45.720
But I thought she loved the dress.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:48.300
She did, but they switched to film in colour.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.720
It changes everything.

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:52.720
So what do we do?

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:54.800
The director's asking for a new dress,

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.720
full of colour.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.720
When for?

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.000
Tomorrow.

